Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
The superfluid boson singlet state of the gauge-covariant spinor field on the \
3+1 manifold of the Lorentz super-loop\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"caadbd93-1493-4769-ad26-854a23988be9"],

Cell["\<\
PROJECT spacetimes, folder Revision_SM_Higgs. The notebook superfluid.nb, \
prepared for Patrick Lee Nash, Ph.D.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"2cc2f383-3604-4602-bfbf-0a9cc81bd9c2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook is the Wolfram Language companion of the manuscript of the \
solution in the same folder, written so that a first-year graduate student in \
physics can follow every step. It states the problem and the conventions, \
defines every object that a computation needs, writes out the equations that \
can be executed, and executes them: the algebra of the manifold M31 and of \
the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor field and the gauge group GEE with its \
covariant derivatives, the field equations and their analytic solutions, the \
condensation of the spinor field into the superfluid boson singlet state by \
the methods of Hubbard and Stratonovich (HS), of Kohn and Sham (KS) and of \
Cornwall, Jackiw and Tomboulis (CJT), the effective Lagrangians and the \
Mexican hat, the breaking of the symmetry and the masses of the gauge bosons, \
the surviving symmetry with its massless gauge boson, the zeugon (not the \
photon: the spinor field, the DiracLike spinor, has electric charge 0 and no \
electroweak quantum numbers), and the dynamics. Every time integration in \
this notebook is done by the method IDA of the function ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; no fixed-step integrator (such as the fourth-order Runge-Kutta method) is \
used anywhere. Parts I to III state the earlier hypotheses, under which all \
this holds. Part R, added on 22 November 2026 for the revision of the \
hypotheses, states the revised hypotheses, under which the superfluid is a \
condensate of pairs of three Dirac fields with the quantum numbers of the \
Higgs doublet of the Standard Model, and repeats the checks of the four \
stages of the revision; it needs only the cells of Chapter 0 before it."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0c98aad5-b0d4-4844-8b62-3cd167de6438"],

Cell["\<\
How to use it. Open the notebook in Wolfram (version 15 or later; it was \
evaluated with Wolfram 15.0.1) and choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. The \
cells are evaluated in order. Nothing outside this notebook is read: every \
definition and every program is inside it. Every check prints one line that \
begins with PASS or FAIL, and the last chapter lists all checks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16e98e6a-237a-4f5a-832c-8bc244d08959"],

Cell["\<\
How to read it. A text cell explains, in words and formulas, what the next \
input cell does and why. Inside the code, comments (* like this *) explain \
each step, and every symbol of the code that stands for an object of the \
physics has a comment with its printed name and its meaning the first time it \
is defined. A symbol of the printed text with the suffix LL is taken \
unchanged from the earlier work of the project on the super-loop; a symbol \
with the suffix SF is introduced by this solution, and one with the suffix SH \
by the revision of the hypotheses (Part R).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eb4c20d7-ccb5-49de-a78f-60d446fc77a9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The checks and their counterparts. Every computation of this notebook is \
also done by a program in Rust and by a program in Python, in the folders ",
 StyleBox["rust/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the folder of the solution; users without a Wolfram license can follow \
the solution with those programs. In Parts I to III every check carries the \
identifier of the same check in the Rust program with the prefix W (for \
example WA-3 is the check A-3 of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "), and the line that it prints names both counterparts. In Part R the \
checks carry the identifiers of the Wolfram scripts of the revision, and each \
names the checks of the Rust and the Python programs that test the same \
statements (Section R.0). The notebook computes its values itself, by methods \
of the Wolfram Language (exact arithmetic where the Rust program computes in \
floating point, symbolic derivatives where it differentiates automatically, \
the solvers of the Wolfram Language where it uses its own); the numbers agree \
with those of the two programs within the tolerances stated in each check."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"56130ad9-b710-4b1d-848f-8a719f902295"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. The register of the checks", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"572df690-9f68-4683-b67b-7f9d31836205"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines the functions that record and print a check. ",
 StyleBox["check[id, text, dev, tol, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a numerical check: it passes when the measured deviation ",
 StyleBox["dev",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is at most the tolerance ",
 StyleBox["tol",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["rust",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " are the identifiers of the same check in the Rust and in the Python \
program. ",
 StyleBox["checkTrue[id, text, ok, detail, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a check that is decided by facts (a count, an exact identity), \
with a short ",
 StyleBox["detail",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Both append an association to the list ",
 StyleBox["SFNB`Test`$Results",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", the register of all checks of this notebook, and print one line. The \
function ",
 StyleBox["sci",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " writes a number with four significant digits in the form ",
 StyleBox["2.857e-8",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", as the reports of the Rust and the Python programs do."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7a8acae4-797e-4fae-afbd-6277cf132253"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "register", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "checks", " ", "of", " ",
      "this", " ", 
     RowBox[{"notebook", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"one", " ", "association", " ", "per", " ", "check"}]}]}], ",", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"in", " ", "the", " ", "order", " ", "of", " ", "evaluation"}]}], 
   " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "number", " ", "x", " ", "with", " ", "four", " ", 
       "significant", " ", "digits"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "written", " ", "as", " ", "mantissa", " ", "e", " ", "exponent", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"for", " ", "example", " ", "2.857", "e"}], "-", "8"}], 
       ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sci", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"y", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "e", ",", " ", "m"}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<0\>\"", ",", " ", "Module"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "y", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"y", "/", 
            RowBox[{"10.", "^", "e"}]}], ",", " ", "0.001"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m", "]"}], " ", ">=", " ", "10"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"m", "/", "10"}]}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"e", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
          RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
           RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
         " ", "\"\<e\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "e", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"called", " ", "after", " ", "every", " ", "check"}]}], ";", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"it", " ", "does", " ", "nothing", " ", "here", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
       "a", " ", "dry", " ", "run", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "code", " ", 
        "without", " ", "the", " ", "front", " ", "end", "\n", "   ", "uses", 
        " ", "it", " ", "to", " ", "print", " ", "the", " ", "computing", " ",
         "time", " ", "of", " ", "each", " ", "check"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "Null"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "dev", ",", " ", "tol", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "numerical", " ", "check"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"passed", " ", "when", " ", "dev"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{"id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dev_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"tol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", 
       "python_String"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"ok", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}], "]"}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "ok"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "tol", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "text"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "ok", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
          
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "dev", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\< (tolerance \>\"", 
          ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "tol", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<): \>\"", ",", " ",
           "text", ",", "\n", "     ", "\"\<   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",",
           " ", "rust", ",", " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",",
           " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "ok"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "ok", ",", " ", "detail", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "check", " ", "decided", " ", "by", " ", "facts"}]}], 
     ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"detail", " ", "states", " ", "them"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", "ok_", ",", " ", 
       "detail_String", ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", "python_String"}], 
      "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"pass", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "ok", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "pass"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{
             "text", " ", "<>", " ", "\"\< [\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", "detail", 
              " ", "<>", " ", "\"\<]\>\""}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "pass", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  \>\"", ",", " ", "text", ",",
           " ", "\"\< [\>\"", ",", " ", "detail", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",", " ", "rust", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "pass"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2b8244a1-4ebb-4ec9-86aa-85ddf92b01a4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part I. The manifold M31, the spinor field, GEE, the field equations and four \
analytic solutions\
\>", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"2de87b10-842b-467b-8e76-55df6fd285b8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Part I treats items 1 to 5 of the problem (Sections 1 to 7 of the \
manuscript): the manifold M31 of the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor fields on \
it and the DiracLike field, the gauge group GEE and its covariant \
derivatives, the Lagrangian with its field equations, and analytic solutions \
of four simple cases. Its checks are those of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", which repeats a part of the checks of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; the random test values of this notebook come from the generator of the \
Wolfram Language with the seed 20261121, so they differ from those of the two \
programs, as theirs differ from each other."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0f8edd69-6545-46a4-bcfb-3439882bd4e6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["I.1 Conventions, units and the common objects", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b0ecdad9-1285-484a-aa0d-a815cb31cac6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Units.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Planck's constant and the speed of light are 1; energies, masses and \
momenta are measured in units of the momentum cutoff ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ffcbe291-f089-4538-88ec-4ee1fb34121d"],
 ", lengths and times in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f25ad7d9-1f1a-4fb1-b8d7-f269942736da"],
 ". The mass of the spinor field is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f5f875d0-16f9-468f-a28b-d35c43e05d2f"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"765af5ef-109e-44e0-bca4-fbabe27fbb37"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Indices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ed7d4d1e-bafe-4cb4-b081-c7828c114952"],
 " run over the four coordinates of M31 (0 is the time), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3714d546-d51e-4eb4-99ea-e93407f5cc26"],
 " over the three space coordinates, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Iota]", ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "213917e6-8bed-4e22-8c2b-178d3a7e23f2"],
 " over the three directions of isospin (an internal direction, not a \
direction in space), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ed86106d-798e-4b1c-9eed-98a030fae664"],
 " over the eight components of the spinor field. The letter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "532080c9-b566-48c4-9d01-b8f79c06ad85"],
 " is always the imaginary unit. The Minkowski metric is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d7d5e126-c4c0-4662-aa55-33fa0ca4d019"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8a319676-2cf5-40d0-ad55-fd47ad56ef6c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Matrices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69b9e1f9-89a0-4b0c-a3df-25ae8d438205"],
 " is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6fd6db5e-5472-4205-9e8f-42c9dcc7b666"],
 " unit matrix and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "1", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8b900362-8a94-406f-8173-606a515ebde0"],
 " are the Pauli matrices; acting on isospin they are written ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e4effc7-3024-46eb-8332-e64e03a225fc"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7891a882-f1fc-46aa-a627-129b19ac0c20"],
 ". The Dirac matrices are those of the chiral basis, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6edb1514-c42d-4644-9b8c-0638ccedc4a0"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c02d18f2-81cd-4682-94d2-7c01820a174b"],
 " off the diagonal and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b7b9761a-8fc9-4c78-bd75-a742c4063a92"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79c4d7e3-d004-4cf9-b9e0-b3c40fe5c06b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d815a8a4-253a-4078-858a-75664dcf4b4e"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1", ",", "1"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e01336b1-5d84-4174-8092-958a25c54f4c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8c4a14da-fe17-425e-b1ac-16cc077a5c2b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0ed7561c-9c78-4df7-a56f-ba0b2213de59"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "45124741-4a03-475a-80e8-da944ee577fe"],
 ". The spinor field ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3493e594-cb46-43f7-a88c-ba616dfb66d4"],
 " has eight components: the Dirac index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "483cd9ff-6fc9-4039-b9f0-e7ab41543f34"],
 " (four values) and the isospin index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f0672f21-9193-47a0-99a5-d5c2b463a21c"],
 " (up, down); a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ae597e13-967d-4b90-ae3d-eab4c2b54c32"],
 " Dirac matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["A", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0eb0a585-4ec6-4c4a-9e9d-ba2ccf2dbc90"],
 " acts on it as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "311a7006-2bb1-4682-bfcb-deb476826798"],
 " and an isospin matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "57f4703a-5730-4307-8ed9-06e2289010c9"],
 " as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "996fd815-84d7-4d43-8e44-031b8a83c11b"],
 ". The isospin generators are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dbdca5c4-7afa-4b25-bfc4-0776ff6b3f6e"],
 ", the matrices of the three spin-zero pair fields are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["K",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "28c97dc9-f5dd-4e8a-b150-76d0902ebc4c"],
 ", and the free Dirac Hamiltonian at the momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69c5f4e2-7761-4ce8-b1dd-a12f10dcd6cc"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b207c0e-dead-4ccb-a23a-b9ce128a7d56"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bc24463-c318-4415-9ea2-f6265fd05047"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The author's conventions (the Standard Model).",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The covariant derivative of the Higgs doublet is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "+", 
      StyleBox["ig", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], "3",
       LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "2"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "+", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["SM",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], ")"}], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dbba3032-5ed9-4ef7-8c98-9f87c01410db"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e630a99-e543-4bbc-b5da-644a8bb42182"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9742125c-df15-4331-a258-643e1957b209"],
 "; the fields of definite mass are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "\[PlusMinus]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "1"], "\[MinusPlus]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "2"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e70725a1-4b5f-4af7-89f7-6fa16c351a44"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "-", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ef42c4e9-4b42-4c99-bf89-b28b3fdf6ab1"],
 " and the photon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "+", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4e899e31-424e-47e3-9118-2819bc6c2833"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1229db08-4751-46db-884a-1108bfeea523"],
 "; with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", 
      StyleBox["v", "TI"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "661547dc-00a2-47b8-9739-dfcbc224519b"],
 " the masses are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["gv", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "09156756-5d06-464a-8e2a-fdb52e83fe9f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"\[Prime]", "2"}]]}]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "24d7ee19-fb66-4ec5-a5eb-b779606a4df6"],
 ", and the photon is massless. All GEE covariant derivatives of the solution \
use the same sign, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "933f7ad2-d46b-4a89-a7d4-a9a1d30be89e"],
 " in front of every coupling. The author gave these conventions to establish \
terms, symbols and conventions for a new gauge-covariant derivative modelled \
after this one but not equal or equivalent to it: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["v",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[Times]", 
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["F",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9147fe87-90f6-4a6e-a623-f4e616cabe11"],
 " is a new gauge group, not the electroweak group, and the spinor field of \
the solution, the DiracLike spinor, has electric charge 0 and no electroweak \
quantum numbers. The solution borrows only the names: its charge ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00ce5f27-2245-4596-acf6-94b715c69d87"],
 " is not the electric charge, and its massless gauge boson, the zeugon, is \
not the photon."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"556ca5bc-043e-4d89-ac52-09c5d6cdcdf2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines these matrices, the bi-quaternions and bi-octonions \
of Section I.2, the Lorentz matrices, the spinor matrices and the operators \
of the Fock space of one point. They are the same objects as those of the \
Rust library ",
 StyleBox["sfcore",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python module ",
 StyleBox["sfcommon.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", written here with the functions of the Wolfram Language."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd721646-0ace-46ea-af15-44a25fc6173d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "mass", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "spinor", " ", "field"}], 
    ",", " ", "m_LL", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "in", " ", "units", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "cutoff", " ", 
      "Lambda_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "5"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       RowBox[{"sigma", "^", "LL_p"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2", ",",
          " ", "3"}], ")"}]}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "sigma_", "0", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "2", " ", "x", " ", "2", " ",
        "unit", " ", "matrix"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "1"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "2"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "3", " ", "the", " ", "Pauli", " ", "matrices"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sig", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sigbar", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       "sigma"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"bar_p", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sigma_", "0", " ", "and"}], " ", "-", "sigma_j"}]}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "blocks", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", 
      "matrices", " ", "below", " ", "the", " ", "diagonal"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sigbar", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"eLL", " ", "is", " ", "E_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"i", " ", "sigma_", "2"}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
