     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e7a3951c-2395-42a6-b128-875025c43d3c"],
 ". The list ",
 StyleBox["gens",
