   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\", Python \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"YQN-2\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"]\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "PASS ", "WQN-2", "  ", 
   "the six real Lorentz generators: S([u, u']) = [S(u), S(u')], independent \
over the reals, commuting with the ten internal generators", " [", 
   "identities of exact matrices; real rank 6", "]   [the same check: Rust ", 
   "QN-2a, QN-2b", ", Python ", "YQN-2", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004331598740284*^9},
