neutral vacuum of H5, breaks Q; one in the neutral part of a channel keeps \
exactly Q", " [", "24 of 24 channels as expected", 
   "]   [the same check: Rust ", "QN-11f, QN-11g", ", Python ", "YQN-11", "]"],
