Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
R.1.13 Remark R8: the electroweak gauge bosons cannot form the condensate\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"cf7037cc-dce4-429b-84f6-e61d253d7f00"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The remark.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " It was first made as \"the electroweak gauge bosons cannot bind the pairs; \
the attraction is the pairing term of the hypotheses\", about the first \
version. That was not correct as stated, and it was corrected during the work \
on the second version: the gauge bosons cannot form the condensate. ",
 StyleBox["Why \"cannot bind\" was false.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " At tree level the exchange of one massless vector boson of a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "587313af-7643-4bd1-bbe2-4f8f5d5eb4d2"],
 " with the coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cf0e581d-d152-44ff-af59-a95d911d703c"],
 " between two particles of the charges ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3534b820-0e9f-4a8e-8153-409bc2d481c0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7a90e22f-bd23-4ec1-9468-04d9367b7a7a"],
 " gives the static potential ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "2"], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"4", "\[Pi]", 
      StyleBox["r", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "57b5c27b-2453-49c5-ad0c-c5680704cd08"],
 "; opposite charges attract, and an attraction proportional to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    StyleBox["r", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "acfe94e0-7bcf-4572-b825-2c32dc27fdb9"],
 " binds two particles however weak it is, as in the hydrogen atom. The next \
cell computes the products of the charges of a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "87eeb155-7042-4b1b-b11e-97a562224cbb"],
 " and a particle of a singlet from the generators of Section R.1.1. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
    StyleBox["a", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "857944e6-4995-4344-851e-89a5f9644c3d"],
 " does not act on the singlets. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cce8f7b2-ac62-4b9f-84c4-1ccd0d2d45bd"],
 " couples to the hypercharges: it repels ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", "\[Chi]"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f5ab05b7-2cb3-4b18-9255-6ce0d3bda38a"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    FractionBox["1", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b2a8c1c7-a6dd-4bf0-bdbf-87377cd26061"],
 ") and, in the second version, attracts ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b49f7f7-a3c7-467a-8757-36c0561de7f5"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["3", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "13656e12-71b5-4179-8525-fa18d699b4e8"],
 ") already in the symmetric vacuum. After the breaking the photon attracts a \
down particle to a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1447c1f9-f77f-4110-b969-f1e25650af9e"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["1", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd73a3bc-f517-4698-ae8b-03eea82f7eff"],
 ") and an up particle to a particle of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Prime]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a1eb1994-2ec0-434b-a814-7590522d1a11"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["9", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ffa0156-b50a-41c2-92b7-4447c6c23acf"],
 "), and repels the other two combinations (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    FractionBox["3", "16"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f21af1ab-4613-4a35-a20d-4d22389be1ae"],
 "). ",
 StyleBox["Why they cannot form the condensate.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " In the vacuum, which has no Fermi surface, a condensate forms only above a \
critical strength of the attraction: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ">", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["crit",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d6b28d48-48c3-461a-8c63-7ddeb03570f3"],
 " for the pairing term (Section R.2), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"], "/", "4", "\[Pi]", ">", "\[Pi]", "/", "3"}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "53f5544d-00df-4680-b307-3a23de3d62de"],
 " for a massless vector boson in the ladder approximation of the \
Schwinger-Dyson equation (T. Maskawa and H. Nakajima, Progress of Theoretical \
Physics 52, 1326 (1974)). The strongest attraction, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["9", "16"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["e", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a812d8b7-5aac-48d7-863c-7e82c6a3335f"],
 ", corresponds to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["9", "16"], "\[CenterDot]", 
    FractionBox["1", "137"], "\[TildeTilde]", "0.004"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "81b2261d-84d5-4c13-b985-6b5a1542567b"],
 ", more than two hundred times below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Pi]", "/", "3"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ad282385-a669-4477-949c-3916b7ab2d07"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["Why it matters.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The superfluid rests on the assumed pairing interaction, whose origin the \
hypotheses do not explain, as in the models in which the Higgs doublet is a \
bound state of the top quark held by a four-fermion interaction (W. A. \
Bardeen, C. T. Hill and M. Lindner, Physical Review D 41, 1647 (1990)); no \
known force can replace it. The fine-structure constant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "137.036"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a3d3c013-70fb-40ad-b6c2-313150729e73"],
 " is the rounded value of the Particle Data Group; no program of the folder \
computes the numbers of this remark except the charges."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"28d3b38c-a51e-4d24-b86f-2d6c86b5b5ab"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"--", 
     RowBox[{"--", " ", "remark"}]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"R8", ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "products", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "charges", " ", "of",
       " ", "a", " ", "particle", " ", "of", " ", "Psi_LL", " ", "and", " ", 
      "a", " ", "particle", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"singlet", " ", "--"}], "--"}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "in", " ", "the", " ", "numbering", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
      "matrices", " ", "from", " ", "1"}], ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "components", " ", "1", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", "up", ")"}], " ", "and", " ", "2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", "down", ")"}], " ", "of", " ", "Psi_LL", " ", "with", " ", 
      "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", "index", " ", "0"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"9", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"(", "chi_SH", ")"}], " ", "and", " ", "13", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"chi", "'"}], "_SH"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r8Comp", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "2"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "9"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "13"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "products", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "hypercharges", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "exchange", " ", "of", " ", "B"}], ")"}], " ", 
     "and", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "electric", " ", "charges", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"the", " ", "exchange", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "photon"}], 
      ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r8Rows", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
           "p", " ", "<>", " ", "\"\< with \>\"", " ", "<>", " ", "s"}], ",", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"YY", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"YY", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n",
            "     ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "p", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"r8Comp", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<down\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}], 
         ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
