Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["R.2.5 Remark R9: the charges of the lightest quasi-particles", \
"Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"96eb862e-52ac-40a0-bb43-2ddac5c2a648"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The remark.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \"The lightest quasi-particle of the superfluid has the electric charge ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   FractionBox["3", "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "406a84d6-18d1-44c8-8304-65bf6bf4b426"],
 ".\" It is true in the first version and not in the second. ",
 StyleBox["First version.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The condensate along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["d",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c3d37b6c-ef18-4e65-b148-c9c2daa757da"],
 " pairs the down component of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "644e67c2-418b-4328-a143-363bb1f0e517"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "39bf4845-c545-4240-98d0-9b7fa9286d8b"],
 " and leaves the up component unpaired; its block of the Bogoliubov-de \
Gennes matrix is that of a free Dirac field of the mass ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["u",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "41b68037-2ce6-4510-8687-3af7c70ac9ca"],
 ", so the lowest excitation is an up particle, of the charge ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   FractionBox["3", "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74fd4b5d-1f54-4737-8a04-9829503ec80a"],
 ", with the energy ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[LeftBracketingBar]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["u",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fef14572-03f6-4e46-9177-9d73a05171e9"],
 " at zero momentum, and this is the gap. ",
 StyleBox["Second version.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Every constituent is paired, the gap is larger in every method, and no \
block is that of a free field. The quasi-particles of the first pair mix a \
down particle with a hole of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "17f70494-8cbb-412f-ae57-96ce44963f07"],
 ", those of the second an up particle with a hole of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Prime]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8964f63b-3bbd-42c8-bc79-1a34ffac51d8"],
 "; a hole carries the opposite charges of the particle that is missing. The \
next cell computes the charges: within each pair the two constituents have \
the same charges, so the mixing keeps them, and the two pairs have ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["R",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     FractionBox["1", "2"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a20cdca0-c2ca-4019-bc4c-0ba15849f599"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "872e62e2-6280-4f41-91c3-897607f85ae4"],
 " with the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d1093a54-43ac-419d-a33c-ac511bb88001"],
 ", a doublet of the custodial group ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["SU", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c5f25cfc-c66e-4656-b42a-800c470d34ae"],
 " that the ground state keeps. The lightest quasi-particles of the second \
version are therefore a doublet of the charges ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["1", "4"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4cdb2c78-96aa-456f-ac34-f60ced8aaae6"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   FractionBox["3", "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ca515127-2964-47ab-9e51-84d3e3b7a61f"],
 ", of one mass, with their antiparticles. ",
 StyleBox["Why it matters.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " No particle of such a charge has been observed, and the lightest of them \
would be stable, since the charges of the particles of the Standard Model are \
multiples of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   FractionBox["1", "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8b646b4d-e31b-4ba5-a873-2ae24a50912c"],
 ". Whether this excludes the model depends on their mass in GeV, the gap \
times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "87dc14fb-8664-4756-a546-d7a58af5b273"],
 ", which stage 4 fixes (Section R.3). The constituents have fractional \
charges because of the chosen hypercharges: with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "433ebbfe-2c43-49ed-812b-d68b81b3ba53"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f2092123-14bc-40b9-8eaf-9fb3d85661c0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], "-", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "092b794b-4bd6-4a6d-a73a-162e71f0df15"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02a56a75-e9bb-414c-89bb-0c00e0117167"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", 
     FractionBox["1", "2"]}], "-", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b885aab3-801d-45ce-b5ab-ac693b10a5b2"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Prime]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "92a3bd28-4d56-48a1-8450-302a7045a495"],
 " the pair fields keep the hypercharges ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0bef3c98-4cdd-4d07-b8f8-9f0fa23ff6cc"],
 " for every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ee4060b1-7456-40cb-be09-8724206c7873"],
 ", and the charges are integers only for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"\[PlusMinus]", 
     FractionBox["1", "2"]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b03a373-27e8-4c5d-8b1b-0700711c72f4"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b69d382-0399-45c6-bc2f-871274f007de"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"--", 
     RowBox[{"--", " ", "remark"}]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"R9", ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "charges", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "constituents", " ", 
       "of", " ", "the", " ", "quasi"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"particles", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "second", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"version", " ", "--"}], "--"}]}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "diagonal", " ", "charges", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
     "hypotheses", " ", "on", " ", "one", " ", "Dirac", " ", "component", " ",
      "of", " ", "each", " ", 
     RowBox[{"species", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"T", "^", "3"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", "SM", ")"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"T", "^", "3"}], "_R", " ", "and", " ", "R"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
  "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r9T3", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r9T3R", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r9R", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "a", " ", "particle", " ", "of", " ", "a", " ", "species", " ", 
      "carries", " ", "its", " ", "charges"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "hole", " ", "their", " ", "negatives"}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Q", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"T", "^", "3"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"T", "^", "3"}], "_R"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"R", "/", "4"}]}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
      RowBox[{"sp_", ",", " ", "sign_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sign", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r9T3", "[", "sp", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"r9T3R", "[", "sp", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r9R", "[", "sp", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r9T3", "[", "sp", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"r9T3R", "[", "sp", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"r9R", "[", "sp", "]"}], "/", "4"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"r9Rows", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<down particle\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", " ", "@@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<hole of chi_SH\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", " ", "@@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<up particle\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", " ", "@@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<hole of chi'_SH\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", " ", "@@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
        RowBox[{"r9Rows", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<constituent\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<T^3 + T^3_R\>\"", ",",
            " ", "\"\<R\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Q\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<the first pair has equal charges: \>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<down\>\"", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
       RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<chi\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
      "  ", "\"\<; the second: \>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<up\>\"", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
       RowBox[{"r9Charges", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<chi'\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "gaps", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Rust", " ", "program", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"data", " ", "cell"}], ")"}]}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
       "in", " ", "the", " ", "first", " ", "version", " ", "the", " ", "gap",
         " ", "is"}], " ", "|", "M_up", "|"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "unpaired", " ", "up", " ", "component"}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"r9h", ",", " ", "r9rows"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"readTable", "[", "grFile", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"r", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"col", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r9h", ",", " ", "\"\<version\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
              "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"r", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"col", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r9h", ",", " ", "\"\<method\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
              "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"num", "[", 
                RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", 
                  RowBox[{"col", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"r9h", ",", " ", "\"\<gap\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                 "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "8"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
             RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                RowBox[{"num", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", 
                   RowBox[{"col", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"r9h", ",", " ", "\"\<M_up\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                  "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "8"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "r9rows"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<version\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<method\>\"", ",", 
           " ", "\"\<gap\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<|M_up|\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
