  SequenceForm[
  "PASS ", "WH-1", "  ", 
   "the effective Lagrangian Z tr((dM)^dag dM) of the bidoublet at M = phi i \
tau^2: chi(T^a, T^b) = chi(T^a_R, T^b_R) = -chi(T^a, T^b_R) = Z phi^2 \
delta_ab; with Y = T^3_R + R/4 the charge Q = T^3 + Y does not respond; the \
mass matrix of (W^1, W^2, W^3, B) has the eigenvalues 0, g^2 Z phi^2 (twice), \
