= omega_H / v_SH (relative); the amplitude modes of the linear response give \
M_H / v from 7.96732 to 10.1624, 15.68 to 20.00 times the value of the \
Standard Model", " [", "deviation 8.766e-17", "]   [the same check: Rust ", 
