   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\", Python \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"YH-7\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"]\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "PASS ", "WH-5", "  ", 
   "HS (0, 0): the identity (k^2 + m^2) / (E (E^2 - w^2/4)) - 1/E = (w^2 - \
