 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e515ea89-0e57-4247-9aa1-01b43ccaa1b1"],
 " the weight of the node times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], "2"], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"2", 
      SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1bb1553e-8753-4748-8149-d0f510ee5c31"],
 ". At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb31c98f-707b-4f0b-b6a1-fe729182ff86"],
 " each vector points against its field; for the ground state this is the gap \
equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["SH",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "2"}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["w", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "/", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29633862-7370-4d83-b72e-e2aa4b077eb8"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
        StyleBox["LL",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
       SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
        StyleBox["SH",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9a1015bd-fde2-442e-9c83-2a315cbe6aef"],
 ", whose solution is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c384e1f-91db-4dfa-8ff7-1183d6bdbb07"],
 ", and a kicked state starts with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      SubsuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", 
       StyleBox["SH",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       StyleBox["kick",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74bd1183-716a-419f-9af5-9275c552a56a"],
 ". The cell integrates the 48 pseudospins with ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and the method IDA of SUNDIALS and compares ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8f3befaa-eb58-4ecb-868c-71d1327fe0ca"],
 " with that of the Rust program, which evolves all sixteen components at 144 \
momenta, for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "50"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ea0623e-9646-46c8-af46-b3959999b854"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["Where it comes from.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " This reduction was found by comparing it with the full computation, not by \
deriving it. Both kinds of pseudospin are needed: with the particles alone \
the phase of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a588bd93-610c-4323-a278-2f014eb31f04"],
 " drifts, which the full computation does not show. ",
 StyleBox["Why it matters.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Its linearization is the response of the theory of Bardeen, Cooper and \
Schrieffer, whose amplitude mode lies at twice the gap parameter, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SH",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8cee4321-1230-4380-ac8d-97a18891c4a8"],
 ": the reduced model explains why the pairing-only methods put the candidate \
for the Higgs boson exactly at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SH",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "996c9251-c02b-4431-8955-549ca3db8e28"],
 ", undamped."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"03d696d9-bb2e-453a-b3d1-c3851df4c49e"],

